entifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/KsfParams"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A failure here is the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"whole","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" of the client’s authentication check, and covers both","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"halves of the mutual authentication: the envelope only opens under the right password, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KE2"},{"text":"’s MAC only verifies if the server actually holds the record. Nothing may be sent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"afterwards (§23.4 rule 7).","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Whether the caller is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"finished","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is a separate question, and one this type deliberately","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"does not answer: under an ","type":"text"},{"code":"optional","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" tenant a failure here is the ordinary case for an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"account that has no registration record yet, and §23.4 rule 7 requires a retry over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"POST \/auth\/login","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". That branch needs the ","type":"text"},{"code":"mode","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" field from the ","type":"text"},{"code":"login\/start","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" response, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it lives in ","type":"text"},{"code":"AxiamClient.loginOpaque","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" where the response is; the error raised here is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same one either way.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"That case is an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/auth(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":", unlike every other refusal in this package. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"distinction is the point: a wrong password, an account that does not exist and a server","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that does not hold the record are indistinguishable by design and are all authentication","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"failures, whereas a key-stretching function this build cannot perform is a configuration","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"problem, and reporting it as “invalid password” would send an operator looking in the wrong","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"place.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Throws","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/auth(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" when the envelope does not open or ","type":"text"},{"code":"KE2","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" does not verify.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Throws","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/network(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" if the exchange is already spent, or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key-stretching function is one this SDK cannot ask for."}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Opens the envelope, producing ","type":"text"},{"code":"KE3","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"mino